						<h3>Episode #6: The Two-Week Carnivore&nbsp;Trial</h3>
						<p>In mid-2024, after analyzing clinical literature on fermentable carbohydrates and oral bacterial acidogenesis, I initiated a strict two-week carnivore elimination trial: eating exclusively pasture-raised ruminant proteins (beef and lamb), animal fats, sea salt, and pure water. The results were immediate and startling: within 96 hours, my burning pain dropped from an agonizing 8/10 baseline down to a mild&nbsp;1/10.</p>
						<p style="margin-top: 0.45rem; padding: 0.35rem 0.65rem; background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.08); border-left: 3px solid #10b981; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.86rem; color: #065f46;">
							<strong>Pain Level Outcome:</strong> Pain plummeted from an 8/10 baseline down to <strong>1/10</strong> in just 4&nbsp;days (over 70% pain reduction).
