						<h3>Episode #7: Strict Carnivore for Six Months (Stable 0/10&nbsp;Baseline)</h3>
						<p>Encouraged by the two-week trial, I committed to a strict zero-carbohydrate elimination protocol for six unbroken months. The results were definitive: my daily pain baseline stabilized at a durable zero out of ten. Speaking, eating, and sleeping returned to normal. For six unbroken months, the burning was completely gone, proving that starving oral acid-producing bacteria allows sensitized trigeminal nerves to de-wind and&nbsp;heal.</p>
