							</figcaption>
						</figure>
						<p>Having decoded the first principles of how open micro-pipes, leaking restorative seals, and bacterial lactic acid trip the trigeminal pain circuit, we examine how medicine formally defines this condition. In Part IV, we dissect the official BMS Standard Diagnosis Model: understanding the recognized criteria of inclusion, the mandatory battery of exclusion tests, and why a clean bill of health is the ultimate proof of neuropathic&nbsp;pain.</p>

